### Get all stores

GET http://localhost:5000/api/stores
Content-Type: application/json

### Get store with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/stores/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create store

POST http://localhost:5000/api/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "store-ny-01",
  "name": "New York Store",
  "address": "123 Example Street, New York"
}

### Update store

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "code": "store-ny-01",
  "name": "New York Store",
  "address": "456 Example Street, New York"
}

### Delete store with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/stores/1
Content-Type: application/json
